`lexer.snt — lexer.sn の契約`
`条文は 名前 : 実際 == 期待（真なら左辺、偽なら __）。__ を期待するなら 名前 : !(実際)`
`ここに書いた呼び出しが lexer.sn の関数の使われ方になり、型はそこから決まる`

`lexer.sn`@~

`--- 空白 ---`
space_is_space : (is_space space) == space
tab_is_space : (is_space tab) == tab
cr_is_space : (is_space cr) == cr
letter_is_not_space : !(is_space \a)

`--- 括り。字下げの印（STX / ETX）も括りである ---`
paren_opens : (open_br \() == \(
block_opens : (open_br blk_open) == blk_open
letter_does_not_open : !(open_br \a)
bracket_closes : (close_br \]) == \]
block_closes : (close_br blk_close) == blk_close

`--- 文字列の保護。閉じるバッククォートまで取る／捨てる ---`
quote_taken : (take_quote (`ab` quote `cd`)) == (`ab` quote)
quote_dropped : (drop_quote (`ab` quote `cd`)) == `cd`

`--- 語の切り出し。深さ 0 の空白だけが語を切る ---`
word_to_space : (take_word 0 `ab cd`) == `ab`
word_keeps_group : (take_word 0 `(a b) c`) == `(a b)`
word_keeps_string : (take_word 0 (quote `a b` quote ` x`)) == (quote `a b` quote)
word_keeps_escape : (take_word 0 (escape space `a b`)) == (escape space `a`)
rest_after_word : (drop_word 0 `ab cd`) == ` cd`
space_dropped : (drop_space `  ab`) == `ab`

`--- 字句解析本体。括りは中へ降りずに丸ごと1語 ---`
four_words : (tokens `foo 123 + bar42`) == [`foo` , `123` , `+` , `bar42`]
group_is_one_word : (tokens `f (a b) c`) == [`f` , `(a b)` , `c`]
string_is_one_word : (tokens (quote `a b` quote ` x`)) == [(quote `a b` quote) , `x`]
block_is_one_word : (tokens (`f ` blk_open `x + 1` blk_close)) == [`f` , (blk_open `x + 1` blk_close)]
word_count : ||tokens `a b c`|| == 3
empty_is_unit : !(tokens ``)
only_spaces_is_unit : !(tokens `   `)
